nsibility. The misuse of this toolkit can result in \u003cb\u003ecriminal charges\u003c/b\u003e brought against the persons in question. \u003cb\u003eThe contributors will not be held responsible\u003c/b\u003e in the event any criminal charges be brought against any individuals misusing this toolkit to break the law.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ci\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eThis toolkit contains materials that can be potentially damaging or dangerous for social media\u003c/b\u003e. Refer to the laws in your province/country before accessing, using,or in any other way utilizing this in a wrong way.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eThis Tool is made for educational purposes only\u003c/b\u003e. Do not attempt to violate the law with anything contained here. \u003cb\u003eIf this is your intention, then Get the hell out of here\u003c/b\u003e!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/i\u003e\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eIt only demonstrates \"how phishing works\". \u003cb\u003eYou shall not misuse the information to gain unauthorized access to someones social media\u003c/b\u003e. However you may try out this at your own risk.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-features\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Features\" href=\"#features\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLatest and updated login pages.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBeginners friendly\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMultiple tunneling options\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLocalhost\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCloudflared\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLocalXpose\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMask URL support\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDocker support\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eInstallation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eJust, Clone this repository -\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/htr-tech/zphisher.git\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003egit clone --depth=1 https://github.com/htr-tech/zphisher.git\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eNow go to cloned directory and run \u003ccode\u003ezphisher.sh\u003c/code\u003e -\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ cd zphisher\n$ bash zphisher.sh\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e$ cd zphisher\n$ bash zphisher.sh\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eOn first launch, It'll install the dependencies and that's it. \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZphisher\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e is installed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eInstallation (Termux)\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-installation-termux\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation (Termux)\" href=\"#installation-termux\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eYou can easily install zphisher in Termux by using tur-repo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ pkg install tur-repo\n$ pkg install zphisher\n$ zphisher\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e$ pkg install tur-repo\n$ pkg install zphisher\n$ zphisher\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eA Note :\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-a-note-\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: A Note :\" href=\"#a-note-\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTermux discourages hacking\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e .. So never discuss anything related to \u003cem\u003ezphisher\u003c/em\u003e in any of the termux discussion groups. For more check : \u003ca href=\"https://wiki.termux.com/wiki/Hacking\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ewiki\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"left\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"https://shell.cloud.google.com/cloudshell/open?cloudshell_git_repo=https://github.com/htr-tech/zphisher.git\u0026amp;tutorial=README.md\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/5fd4ed6317ccb591be0d2df13f336abcdcf6184c30847dc68cdfef56143150c4/68747470733a2f2f677374617469632e636f6d2f636c6f75647373682f696d616765732f6f70656e2d62746e2e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://gstatic.com/cloudssh/images/open-btn.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eInstallation via \".deb\" file\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-installation-via-deb-file\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation via \u0026quot;.deb\u0026quot; file\" href=\"#installation-via-deb-file\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eDownload \u003ccode\u003e.deb\u003c/code\u003e files from the \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/htr-tech/zphisher/releases/latest\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLatest Release\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIf you are using \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003etermux\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e then download the \u003ccode\u003e*_termux.deb\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eInstall the \u003ccode\u003e.deb\u003c/code\u003e file by executing\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"apt install \u0026lt;your path to deb file\u0026gt;\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003eapt install \u0026lt;your path to deb file\u0026gt;\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eOr\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ dpkg -i \u0026lt;your path to deb file\u0026gt;\n$ apt install -f\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e$ dpkg -i \u0026lt;your path to deb file\u0026gt;\n$ apt install -f\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eRun on Docker\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-run-on-docker\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Run on Docker\" href=\"#run-on-docker\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eDocker Image Mirror:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDockerHub\u003c/strong\u003e :\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"docker pull htrtech/zphisher\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003edocker pull htrtech/zphisher\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGHCR\u003c/strong\u003e :\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"docker pull ghcr.io/htr-tech/zphisher:latest\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003edocker pull ghcr.io/htr-tech/zphisher:latest\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eBy using the wrapper script \u003ca href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/htr-tech/zphisher/master/run-docker.sh\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003erun-docker.sh\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ curl -LO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/htr-tech/zphisher/master/run-docker.sh\n$ bash run-docker.sh\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e$ curl -LO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/htr-tech/zphisher/master/run-docker.sh\n$ bash run-docker.sh\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eTemporary Container\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"docker run --rm -ti htrtech/zphisher\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003edocker run --rm -ti htrtech/zphisher\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRemember to mount the \u003ccode\u003eauth\u003c/code\u003e directory.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n  \u003csummary\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eDependencies\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-dependencies\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Dependencies\" href=\"#dependencies\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/summary\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eZphisher\u003c/b\u003e requires following programs to run properly -\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003egit\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode\u003ecu